-free-gnf-notation\">73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.6 and Fig. 4.9, pp. 95–97; scans 103–105; local epsilon extension"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.6 and Fig. 4.9, pp. 95–97; scans 103–105; local epsilon extension"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>。带开始符号空词例外的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GNF}\">\\(\\operatorname{GNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e0500c2bc141b62\" href=\"?note=9e0500c2bc141b62\" title=\"73-df-standard-gnf\">73-df-standard-gnf</a>；仅含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to a\\beta\">\\(A\\to a\\beta\\)</span> 的旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{GNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d052b2bc0fd1af00\" href=\"?note=d052b2bc0fd1af00\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation\">73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation</a>，均取同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;[\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\land L(G)=L]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;[\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\land L(G)=L]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{GNF}\\;L(G)=L\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{GNF}\\;L(G)=L\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>原书将变量排序，以代入和消除立即左递归使右部从终结符开始。处理 L 去掉 ε 后，可另加一个不出现在右部的新开始符号，复制原开始符号的终结开头规则，并在需要时加入新开始符号的空产生式，得到第一式。此扩展步骤已说明，不能冒充原书原句。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-standard-gnf","status":"resolved","id":"9e0500c2bc141b62","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-standard-gnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation","stat